      </dataPath>
      <toolTip>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>JWT token authentication (RFC 7519).
This is a more advanced form of authentication than OpenID and OpenID Connect.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>احراز هویت با توکن JWT (RFC 7519).
این شکل پیشرفته‌تری از احراز هویت نسبت به OpenID و OpenID Connect است.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Аутентификация с помощью JWT-токенов (стандарт RFC 7519).
Более продвинутая аутентификация по сравнению с OpenID и OpenID-Connect</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>JWT yetkilendirme cihazının yardımıyla doğrulama (RFC 7519).
OpenID ve OpenID-Connect ile karşılaştırmasında daha gelişmiş bir doğrulamadır</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Xác thực thông qua token JWT (tiêu chuẩn RFC 7519).
Xác thực nâng cao hơn so với OpenID và OpenID-Connect</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>JWT token authentication (RFC 7519).
This is a more advanced form of authentication than OpenID and OpenID Connect.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>JWT token authentication (RFC 7519).
This is a more advanced form of authentication than OpenID and OpenID Connect.</value>
      </toolTip>
